BASE INSTALLATION
-----------------
Using installation guide here:
https://docs.openstack.org/install-guide/environment-packages-rdo.html#finalize-the-installation

sudo dnf install dnf-plugins-core
sudo dnf install centos-release-openstack-victoria
sudo dnf upgrade
sudo vim /etc/yum.repos.d/CentOS-Advanced-Virtualization.repo
- comment out mirrorlist and set baseurl to sudo https://mirror.stream.centos.org/SIGs/8/virt/x86_64/advanced-virtualization/ 

sudo vim /etc/yum.repos.d/CentOS-Ceph-Nautilus.repo
sudo vim /etc/yum.repos.d/CentOS-CR.repo.rpmsave
sudo vim /etc/yum.repos.d/CentOS-NFV-OpenvSwitch.repo 
sudo vim /etc/yum.repos.d/CentOS-OpenStack-victoria.repo
- comment out mirrorlist, remove comment from baseurl and change 'mirror' to 'vault'

sudo dnf install python3-openstackclient
sudo dnf install openstack-selinux

