ETCD
-----------------
https://docs.openstack.org/install-guide/environment-etcd-rdo.html
In file /etc/etcd/etcd.conf, change all localhost strings to the mgmt IP (there seems to be ETCD_LISTEN_PEER_URLS missing in instructions). Also uncomment of course
